        417,
        1123,
        1337,
        1189
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. There is hereby created an Office of Electronic Data Processing within the Municipal Service Administration (MSA) which shall have the following functions and duties:",
      "logprob_stats": {
