      "bbox": [
        461,
        1191,
        1337,
        1259
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "1. Provide data processing hardware and system software resources to City agencies that lack such capability. This service shall be provided through centralized computer facilities and related technologies.",
      "logprob_stats": {
